  "type": "module",
  "description": "The 561-group math: the bilattice predication floor, the categorical hyperdoctrine over it, a charge readout utility, and Chu spaces, as one catalog addressed by subpath. Import the floor at @561-group/math/bilattice (the four-regime descent articulate → predicate → posit → settle over a lossless four-valued evidence carrier; charge value-algebra, both cone pairs, the void reads; zero dependencies), the opt-in categorical layer at @561-group/math/hyperdoctrine (quantifier adjoints, Frobenius reciprocity, Beck-Chevalley, Lawvere comprehension over a finite fibration), the FOUR-place readout utility at @561-group/math/readout (place/knowledgeWeight/salience, a validated style-table lookup), and the Chu layer at @561-group/math/chu (Chu spaces over FOUR, the *-autonomous duality and the Chu transforms that make Chu(FOUR) a category, every operation delegating to a bilattice morphism). Narrower modules hang off each (e.g. @561-group/math/bilattice/charge, @561-group/math/hyperdoctrine/adjoints, @561-group/math/chu/transform).",
